      "name": null,
      "problem": "Find ${lim}_{t\\to \\pi /12}{v}_{2}(t)\\,=\\,$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "Substituting $t=\\frac{\\pi }{12}$ directly into the limit, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{t\\to \\pi /12}{v}_{2}(t) & ={lim}_{t\\to \\pi /12}t\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4t) \\\\  & =(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{12}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{24}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
